<title>AUSTRALIA: RTRS-Goldfields yr net profit A$14.19 mln.</title>
<headline>RTRS-Goldfields yr net profit A$14.19 mln.</headline>
<dateline>SYDNEY 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to June 30</p>
<p>		 (million A$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Operating profit		    24.37 vs 59.33</p>
<p>    Net				     14.19 vs 92.96</p>
<p>    Final dividend (cents)		3.0 vs nil</p>
<p>NOTE: Goldfields Ltd is about 57 percent owned by RGC Ltd and holds 87.2 percent of Pancontinental Mining Ltd. The results are not directly comparable as they include eight months of RGC non-gold operations and one month of Pancontinental gold operations.  </p>
<p>    Total dividend (cents)	     3.0  vs   3.0</p>
<p>    Sales				  249.91 vs 278.07</p>
<p>    Other income			   5.32 vs 337.39</p>
<p>    Shr (cents)			    5.9  vs  80.5</p>
<p>    Abnormal items			 3.06 vs  59.50</p>
<p>Dividend is unfranked.</p>
<p>Pay date Oct 29</p>
<p>Reg date Sept 26</p>
<p>    Tax				     10.13 vs 44.01</p>
<p>    Interest				 5.82 vs 17.51</p>
<p>    Depreciation			  45.27 vs 47.84</p>
<p>-- Sydney newsroom 61-2 373 1800</p>
